n he said to his people, \"Worship Allāh and fear Him. That is best for you, if you should know.","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"29:17","t":"You only worship, besides Allāh, idols, and you produce a falsehood. Indeed, those you worship besides Allāh do not possess for you [the power of] provision. So seek from Allāh provision and worship Him and be grateful to Him. To Him you will be returned.\"","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"29:18","t":"And if you [people] deny [the message] - already nations before you have denied. And there is not upon the Messenger except [the duty of] clear notification.","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"29:19","t":"Have they not considered how Allāh begins creation and then repeats it? Indeed that, for Allāh, is easy.","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"29:20","t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Travel through the land and observe how He began creation. Then Allāh will produce the final creation [i.e., development]. Indeed Allāh, over all things, is competent.\"","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"29:21","t":"He punishes whom He wills and has mercy upon whom He wills, and to Him you will be returned.","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"29:22","t":"And you will not cause failure [to Allāh] upon the earth or in the heaven. And you have not other than Allāh any protector or any helper.","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"29:23","t":"And the ones who disbelieve in the signs of Allāh and the meeting with Him - those have despaired of My mercy, and they will have a painful punishment.","j":20,"h":40,"s":29,"a":23,"sd":null}],"juz":20,"hizb":40,"surahs":[29],"sajdah":false}